        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woven with strips of gilt, silver thread, and gold silk. The silver thread is wound with cream colored linen, which shows through. In the middle is a strip of fancy weaving, done with silver thread; beyond this are strips of gilt and yellow and silver thread.  On the edges are looped yellow threads."@en ;
